				\begin{document}$$K \in \{2, \ldots , 20\}$$\end{document} in Additional file 1: Supplementary Note 11. The null control uses random cluster labels (shuffled within the cell population) and confirms no false-positive inflation: under uninformative strata, CSSI-max AUROC is equal to or below pooled AUROC across all K values tested. Full details and the formal dilution model are in Additional file 1: Supplementary Notes 1 and 11.

